WEBVTT

00:16.140 --> 00:17.900
Everyone who has used this drug

00:20.690 --> 00:22.830
will eventually be killed by me.

00:29.110 --> 00:29.880
Mentor,

00:34.290 --> 00:35.640
will you kill me, too?

00:55.860 --> 00:57.410
Actually, I can do it myself

00:58.990 --> 01:00.450
instead of bothering you.

01:02.400 --> 01:04.400
You don't know what you'll become.

01:06.110 --> 01:07.310
When that time comes,

01:09.420 --> 01:10.620
only I can do it.

01:11.820 --> 01:12.680
What about you?

01:14.460 --> 01:15.840
It's not fair to you.

01:18.940 --> 01:20.270
At a time like this,

01:20.300 --> 01:22.030
can you stop worrying about me?

01:23.730 --> 01:25.210
We owe you our lives.

01:25.770 --> 01:29.360
-If we hadn't met you back then...
-Then why didn’t you listen to me?

01:29.360 --> 01:31.490
Why did you insist on going to Nanyang?

01:32.590 --> 01:34.920
Isn't this the ending you chose yourself?

01:54.900 --> 01:56.180
If killing me

01:57.240 --> 01:58.370
will bring you pain,

02:00.600 --> 02:03.110
I'd rather die on the way
to kill Mo Yungao.

02:18.970 --> 02:19.800
Next,

02:21.810 --> 02:24.070
please leave the hardest missions to me.

02:31.250 --> 02:32.290
Just consider it

02:37.760 --> 02:39.490
me being willful one last time.

02:57.280 --> 02:57.920
Okay.

03:00.100 --> 03:00.960
Suit yourself.

03:08.500 --> 03:10.630
I was paralyzed in Nanyang for 3 years,

03:11.370 --> 03:13.170
and he took care of me for 3 years.

03:14.690 --> 03:16.090
This is not what I wanted.

03:17.930 --> 03:20.260
It's the last outcome
I ever wished to see.

03:44.340 --> 03:45.540
Do whatever you like.

05:36.860 --> 05:42.780
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

05:43.250 --> 05:45.830
[Episode 18]

05:50.960 --> 05:57.780
[Here rests my late father,
Mr. Dong Shi Chang]

05:57.870 --> 06:03.850
[Erected faithfully by the daughter,
Dong Zhuohua]

06:04.020 --> 06:06.180
[Xiacheng Law Firm]
[Last Will and Testament]

06:06.180 --> 06:09.360
[Testator: Dong Shichang]
[Recipient: Zhang Haiqi]

06:18.000 --> 06:18.680
My Lady,

06:20.070 --> 06:22.950
are you really going to dismiss everyone
in the Dong family

06:22.950 --> 06:25.210
and leave Xiacheng to live abroad alone?

06:26.330 --> 06:28.670
Please let us stay and take care of you.

06:30.430 --> 06:31.350
Don't bother.

06:32.420 --> 06:34.350
About the Dong family's property,

06:34.860 --> 06:37.010
I will transfer it to Father's nephew.

06:37.450 --> 06:41.830
[Here rests my late father,
Mr. Dong Shi Chang]

06:44.300 --> 06:45.950
Let me have some time alone

06:47.240 --> 06:48.180
with my father.

07:06.830 --> 07:08.890
I specifically chose this cemetery.

07:11.800 --> 07:13.540
So you and your real daughter

07:14.010 --> 07:14.750
can reunite.

07:40.800 --> 07:41.860
Zhuohua.

07:50.390 --> 07:51.450
Zhuohua!

08:00.040 --> 08:01.100
Thank you

08:01.530 --> 08:03.790
for lending me your identity for so long.

08:04.860 --> 08:07.260
I'm returning Miss Dong's identity to you.

08:09.950 --> 08:11.150
Please rest in peace.

08:23.070 --> 08:25.000
Life is but a fleeting encounter.

08:26.300 --> 08:27.130
Nothing

08:28.660 --> 08:30.000
lasts forever.

09:08.870 --> 09:12.650
[Xiacheng to Changxiang]

09:13.960 --> 09:14.860
You know what?

09:14.860 --> 09:15.910
My mother is

09:17.220 --> 09:18.630
very easygoing.

09:18.630 --> 09:19.790
She likes whatever I like.

09:19.790 --> 09:21.990
Sir, would you like to buy some flowers?

09:22.200 --> 09:23.040
I'll take one.

09:24.550 --> 09:24.960
Here.

09:26.840 --> 09:27.590
Here you are.

09:28.120 --> 09:28.720
Thank you.

09:28.980 --> 09:29.640
No problem.

09:29.960 --> 09:31.120
Would you like to buy some flowers?

09:31.120 --> 09:31.860
No, thanks.

09:32.430 --> 09:32.870
Okay.

09:34.390 --> 09:37.010
Sir, would you like to buy some flowers
for the lady?

09:37.010 --> 09:38.630
No, thanks. I'm his mother.

09:40.250 --> 09:42.180
My mother had me when she was young.

09:42.810 --> 09:44.340
I'll take the whole basket.

09:44.910 --> 09:46.040
Thank you, sir.

09:46.370 --> 09:47.320
Thank you, lady.

09:58.920 --> 10:00.250
What are you looking at?

10:05.280 --> 10:06.130
Mentor,

10:06.790 --> 10:07.440
didn't you say

10:07.440 --> 10:09.970
we should keep a low profile
during this trip?

10:10.370 --> 10:11.840
Why does it feel like
every man in this carriage

10:11.840 --> 10:13.300
wants to be my stepfather?

10:13.940 --> 10:15.460
I was born beautiful.

10:15.460 --> 10:17.110
I'd look good even in a sack.

10:17.580 --> 10:19.310
If you don't want a stepfather,

10:19.430 --> 10:20.760
figure it out yourself.

10:25.130 --> 10:26.680
And this little rabbit...

10:29.400 --> 10:30.930
Say thank you to the mister.

10:32.570 --> 10:33.650
Thank you, sir.

10:33.650 --> 10:34.650
Don't mention it.

10:35.790 --> 10:36.480
He's a martial artist.

10:36.480 --> 10:37.610
That's impressive.

10:38.030 --> 10:38.750
Yes.

10:38.750 --> 10:40.270
Not bad.

10:40.630 --> 10:41.740
He's trained in the martial arts.

10:41.740 --> 10:42.550
Impressive.

10:44.060 --> 10:45.990
He's got some martial arts skills.

10:46.780 --> 10:48.510
His skills are really awesome.

10:51.890 --> 10:52.700
Mentor,

10:53.200 --> 10:54.820
after becoming one of the Zhangs,

10:54.820 --> 10:56.140
my body has grown more agile—

10:56.140 --> 10:57.740
I've truly become stronger.

10:58.370 --> 10:59.790
If you don't train,

11:00.390 --> 11:02.990
having Zhang blood alone
will get you nowhere.

11:06.030 --> 11:08.360
But I think you're really getting senile.

11:09.320 --> 11:10.130
How could you

11:11.290 --> 11:13.420
let Zhang Haixia go on a mission alone?

11:14.140 --> 11:15.700
His current physical condition

11:15.700 --> 11:16.720
can't handle it.

11:17.120 --> 11:20.050
Only he knows the best
whether he can handle it or not.

11:20.160 --> 11:22.620
He needs to be treated
as a normal person now.

11:22.700 --> 11:23.630
Neither you nor I

11:24.080 --> 11:26.250
have the right to make decisions for him.

11:26.250 --> 11:29.050
But he's just recovered
from a serious condition.

11:32.850 --> 11:34.330
Stop messing around!

11:35.050 --> 11:36.510
What are you trying to say?

11:38.120 --> 11:39.300
He has really been

11:40.830 --> 11:41.690
acting weird lately.

11:41.690 --> 11:43.390
I feel like he's hiding something from me.

11:43.390 --> 11:45.120
Did he take the wrong medicine?

11:45.200 --> 11:46.260
Does that medicine

11:46.860 --> 11:48.120
have any side effects?

11:48.370 --> 11:49.290
Maybe.

11:49.740 --> 11:51.050
Since you're worried about him,

11:51.050 --> 11:52.580
just keep a close eye on him.

11:52.620 --> 11:55.050
What do you mean "maybe"?
Y-You have no idea?

11:55.050 --> 11:57.740
Zhang Hailou, you've grown up a bit.

11:58.390 --> 12:00.390
It's time for you to take care of him.

12:06.750 --> 12:08.750
Hurry up and look through the files.

12:13.750 --> 12:16.320
[Investigation Report]

12:14.910 --> 12:16.000
Zhang Qishan.

12:16.350 --> 12:17.720
[Zhang Qishan is from the Zhang family
in Northeast China]

12:17.740 --> 12:18.940
[He's the grandson
of the former Zhang Qiling.]

12:19.170 --> 12:21.810
The Mo faction warlords once
committed crimes at Panhua Reef.

12:21.810 --> 12:23.610
Haixia's report stated that

12:23.980 --> 12:27.040
the Mo faction warlords were
highly wary of one person.

12:27.270 --> 12:28.250
That was Zhang Qishan.

12:28.250 --> 12:30.550
From Panhua Reef all the way here...

12:30.550 --> 12:32.130
Based on my assessment,

12:32.130 --> 12:34.340
ordinary people can't possibly
have swum this distance—

12:34.340 --> 12:35.550
except for Zhang Qishan.

12:35.430 --> 12:36.180
[The foundation of the Old Nine Clans:
In Changxiang,]

12:35.550 --> 12:37.520
Zhang Qishan is no ordinary man.

12:36.200 --> 12:36.930
[Zhang Qishan gradually befriended
capable figures to build up his strength]

12:36.950 --> 12:37.840
[and has successfully established
the Old Nine Clans now.]

12:37.820 --> 12:39.580
He is the Defense Commander of Changxiang

12:38.000 --> 12:38.700
[Zhang Qishan has used this case
to enhance his reputation]

12:38.720 --> 12:39.410
[and his influence in Changxiang.]

12:39.580 --> 12:42.320
as well as the head
of the famous Old Nine Clans.

12:42.700 --> 12:43.820
Old Nine Clans?

12:44.480 --> 12:45.410
Are they famous?

12:45.460 --> 12:46.580
I've never heard of them.

12:46.580 --> 12:48.050
You spent most of your time in Nanyang.

12:48.050 --> 12:49.390
It's normal
that you haven't heard of them.

12:49.390 --> 12:52.670
The Old Nine Clans are
9 prominent families in Changxiang.

12:52.670 --> 12:54.620
They mainly deal
in tomb raiding and antiques.

12:54.620 --> 12:56.250
Their specific backgrounds are
very complicated.

12:56.250 --> 12:58.340
Rumor has it
that these 9 families are omnipotent,

12:58.340 --> 13:00.960
and Zhang Qishan, their head,
is even more extraordinary.

13:00.960 --> 13:04.080
He's nothing but a man with a military
and political background,

13:04.080 --> 13:05.790
some dirty money from the business world,

13:05.790 --> 13:06.770
and some power.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.780
You're underestimating him.

13:09.630 --> 13:10.700
Zhang Qishan

13:10.700 --> 13:13.030
came from a declining family in the north.

13:13.050 --> 13:14.320
Despite his humble origins,

13:14.320 --> 13:15.580
within just two years,

13:16.200 --> 13:18.320
he has gained a foothold in Changxiang.

13:18.320 --> 13:20.500
It's said that when he first arrived
in Changxiang,

13:20.500 --> 13:22.760
he went on an outing with someone one day.

13:23.120 --> 13:25.530
Seeing a giant Buddha statue
standing in the mountains,

13:25.530 --> 13:26.750
he made a bet

13:27.370 --> 13:29.940
that he could bring
the giant Buddha statue home.

13:29.940 --> 13:31.870
But the giant Buddha statue was built
against the mountain,

13:31.870 --> 13:33.670
as tall as a bell tower.

13:34.050 --> 13:35.500
People simply didn't believe it.

13:35.500 --> 13:36.600
But the next day,

13:38.010 --> 13:40.120
this giant Buddha statue really appeared

13:40.120 --> 13:41.840
in the courtyard of his mansion.

13:41.840 --> 13:43.220
The news spread

13:43.250 --> 13:45.310
throughout the city overnight,

13:45.670 --> 13:48.460
saying that Zhang Qishan knew
a mysterious transport technique—

13:48.460 --> 13:49.920
the Five Ghosts Delivery.

13:50.290 --> 13:53.250
That's how Zhang Qishan
shot to fame overnight.

13:53.250 --> 13:55.110
People all respectfully call him

13:55.340 --> 13:56.820
Great Master Buddha Zhang.

13:56.820 --> 13:58.280
Is he really that capable?

14:02.750 --> 14:04.280
Have you fought him before?

14:04.550 --> 14:05.880
We've had some contact.

14:07.200 --> 14:08.460
But the problem is

14:09.630 --> 14:11.290
that he doesn't want to see me.

14:11.370 --> 14:11.910
Why?

14:12.620 --> 14:15.410
I read the Case Closure Report
of Panhua Reef back then

14:15.410 --> 14:18.340
and saw that the warlords there were
so afraid of him.

14:18.630 --> 14:20.770
It meant he was their enemy,

14:21.170 --> 14:23.770
or at least he had crossed paths
with Mo Yungao.

14:23.860 --> 14:25.750
Later, I investigated Zhang Qishan

14:25.750 --> 14:28.940
and directly sent some pros to Changxiang
for intelligence collection.

14:28.940 --> 14:31.390
But he had eyes and ears
everywhere in Changxiang.

14:31.390 --> 14:34.010
He actually caught the agents I sent

14:34.010 --> 14:34.960
within a day

14:34.960 --> 14:36.560
and sent them out of the city.

14:36.820 --> 14:37.960
Upon learning this,

14:37.960 --> 14:40.360
I immediately mailed a gift from Xiacheng
to apologize,

14:40.360 --> 14:42.500
hoping to use it as an excuse
to visit him.

14:42.500 --> 14:44.030
But the next day,

14:44.390 --> 14:45.890
the gift was returned

14:46.320 --> 14:48.770
with an extra package from Changxiang.

14:51.440 --> 14:52.790
"Not a third time"?

14:53.750 --> 14:55.550
Zhang Qishan is quite arrogant.

14:55.890 --> 14:56.440
No.

14:57.790 --> 15:00.050
Actually, what he said reminded me.

15:00.290 --> 15:01.320
A long time ago,

15:01.320 --> 15:03.320
I heard a saying in the Zhang family.

15:03.550 --> 15:05.360
"Having been separated by mountains
and seas for a thousand years,

15:05.360 --> 15:07.020
we cannot reunite in sorrow."

15:07.500 --> 15:10.890
In the Zhang family's proverb,
mountains and seas are

15:10.890 --> 15:13.230
two groups of people who can never meet.

15:13.260 --> 15:14.920
When mountains and seas meet,

15:15.630 --> 15:17.410
the Zhang family is bound to perish.

15:17.410 --> 15:19.030
So when he told you
not to try a third time,

15:19.030 --> 15:20.160
he was reminding you

15:21.390 --> 15:23.630
that mountains and seas should never meet.

15:23.630 --> 15:25.080
But our trip this time

15:25.440 --> 15:27.010
will be the third try.

15:33.320 --> 15:33.920
By the way,

15:35.080 --> 15:37.280
when I went down to the Archives before,

15:37.790 --> 15:39.250
a weirdo changed his face

15:39.250 --> 15:40.030
and followed me down.

15:40.030 --> 15:41.250
I thought you sent him

15:41.250 --> 15:42.630
to supervise me.

15:43.020 --> 15:44.950
Now I'm wondering if it could be...

15:48.240 --> 15:49.170
That's why I said

15:50.200 --> 15:52.300
our trip to visit our relatives
in Changxiang this time

15:52.300 --> 15:54.390
would definitely be full of obstacles.

15:54.390 --> 15:55.320
If that's the case,

15:55.320 --> 15:56.510
this family visit

15:57.460 --> 15:58.990
will be quite interesting.

16:18.890 --> 16:21.820
[Changxiang City]

16:21.950 --> 16:25.780
[Changxiang]

16:35.170 --> 16:37.100
Let's have something to eat first.

16:38.010 --> 16:38.870
Sir,

16:38.870 --> 16:40.700
2 bowls of rice noodles
and a pot of wine.

16:40.700 --> 16:41.630
Coming right up.

16:56.840 --> 16:57.620
Here you go.

16:58.580 --> 16:59.370
These rice noodles

16:59.370 --> 17:00.410
need some chili

17:00.410 --> 17:01.130
to taste better.

17:01.130 --> 17:02.410
It's mildly spicy. Give it a try.

17:02.410 --> 17:03.440
Mildly spicy?

17:03.440 --> 17:04.770
Mildly spicy isn't enough.

17:04.770 --> 17:05.920
We need extra spicy.

17:06.460 --> 17:07.260
Sir and madam,

17:07.440 --> 17:09.920
I can tell you're not locals here
in Changxiang.

17:09.920 --> 17:11.650
Mildly spicy is enough for you.

17:11.740 --> 17:13.200
Hand me that chili.

17:13.770 --> 17:15.010
I think you guys in Changxiang

17:15.010 --> 17:16.960
really don't know how much chili
people who eat spicy food want.

17:16.960 --> 17:17.980
Let me, someone from Xiacheng,

17:17.980 --> 17:19.510
teach you, a local in Changxiang,
how to eat spicy food.

17:19.510 --> 17:20.310
Bring it here.

17:20.750 --> 17:21.540
Okay.

17:25.310 --> 17:26.579
Here comes the chili.

17:35.010 --> 17:37.030
Here is the wine. Enjoy your meal.

17:40.480 --> 17:42.280
I feel like no one is watching us.

17:42.500 --> 17:43.700
Mentor, were we a bit

17:43.730 --> 17:45.020
overreacting before?

17:50.240 --> 17:52.430
Come and take a look at the magic trick!

17:52.740 --> 17:54.500
Everyone, come and take a look.

17:55.400 --> 17:56.460
Look over here!

18:00.570 --> 18:01.510
Sir,

18:01.660 --> 18:02.850
I'm terribly sorry.

18:02.940 --> 18:03.590
So sorry.

18:03.590 --> 18:04.180
Bro,

18:05.250 --> 18:06.200
your magic trick

18:06.200 --> 18:06.980
is so interesting.

18:06.980 --> 18:08.330
Why don't you conjure up
another bowl of noodles

18:08.330 --> 18:09.330
to compensate me?

18:09.550 --> 18:10.400
Wait, this...

18:14.290 --> 18:14.960
Oh, lady,

18:15.640 --> 18:17.850
judging by your looks and dress,

18:17.850 --> 18:19.650
you're not a local here, are you?

18:19.790 --> 18:21.320
What are you talking about?

18:22.240 --> 18:22.700
Well,

18:23.500 --> 18:24.720
I see this lady

18:25.070 --> 18:26.800
with a face full of depression.

18:27.030 --> 18:28.940
There must be something troubling her.

18:28.940 --> 18:31.800
What makes you think
her face is full of depression?

18:32.310 --> 18:33.840
Are you trying to hit on her?

18:34.310 --> 18:35.910
I wouldn't dare, I wouldn't.

18:36.250 --> 18:38.380
I'm just a street performer.

18:38.380 --> 18:39.660
I can do a bit of magic tricks,

18:39.660 --> 18:41.190
I'm good at reading people,

18:41.250 --> 18:42.850
and I can foresee the future.

18:43.530 --> 18:44.070
Lady,

18:44.460 --> 18:45.900
if you don't mind,

18:45.900 --> 18:47.750
you can listen to my rambling for a bit.

18:47.750 --> 18:48.500
Perhaps

18:48.920 --> 18:50.350
it can ease your worries

18:50.350 --> 18:51.550
and make you smile.

18:51.550 --> 18:53.410
Nonsense. Swindler, step aside.

18:53.900 --> 18:55.460
Sir, I want another bowl of rice noodles.

18:55.460 --> 18:56.390
Coming right up.

18:56.640 --> 18:57.880
How is it nonsense?

18:59.030 --> 19:01.020
Look at this lady's face.

19:01.850 --> 19:03.700
She is definitely no ordinary person.

19:03.700 --> 19:05.050
Her forehead is full,

19:05.290 --> 19:07.690
and her cheekbones are elegant and bright.

19:07.810 --> 19:09.940
Amazing.

19:10.960 --> 19:12.420
Unlike this young man,

19:12.770 --> 19:14.850
who looks like he's been trapped
in a foreign land for a long time,

19:14.850 --> 19:16.770
hasn't seen much of the wider world,

19:16.770 --> 19:18.290
and is short-sighted

19:18.290 --> 19:19.700
with no real ambition.

19:20.220 --> 19:20.640
Yet he's...

19:20.640 --> 19:22.700
-What are you saying?
-How much is it?

19:26.330 --> 19:27.130
Let go, let go.

19:27.510 --> 19:28.330
Let go!

19:28.420 --> 19:32.150
[Changxiang Rice Noodles]

19:29.250 --> 19:29.830
Come on.

19:30.750 --> 19:31.330
Miss.

19:31.900 --> 19:32.420
Put it here.

19:32.420 --> 19:33.550
It's not expensive.

19:33.640 --> 19:34.330
Six wen.

19:34.810 --> 19:35.610
Six wen?

19:36.510 --> 19:37.530
I don't have 6 wen.

19:39.140 --> 19:40.070
Keep the change.

19:46.310 --> 19:47.140
Wow,

19:47.140 --> 19:48.600
you're so generous, miss.

19:50.570 --> 19:53.100
Miss, I guess you came
to Changxiang this time

19:53.550 --> 19:55.350
to look for an old acquaintance.

19:58.110 --> 19:59.680
What a pity.

19:59.680 --> 20:02.240
"Searching high and low,

20:02.240 --> 20:03.640
you cannot find them

20:04.250 --> 20:06.090
anywhere."

20:08.110 --> 20:10.370
Your meeting with your old acquaintance

20:10.420 --> 20:12.020
probably won't go smoothly.

20:12.270 --> 20:14.130
And you will face many obstacles.

20:14.720 --> 20:16.520
In addition to those obstacles,

20:16.610 --> 20:19.050
even if you see the person
you want to see,

20:19.050 --> 20:20.050
things

20:20.420 --> 20:22.440
may not go as you wish.

20:24.420 --> 20:25.240
I'm afraid

20:25.960 --> 20:28.020
there will even be a bloody disaster.

20:28.500 --> 20:29.660
I hope you

20:29.660 --> 20:31.720
can let go of your obsession.

20:31.740 --> 20:32.440
Perhaps

20:32.880 --> 20:34.340
you can escape a calamity.

20:36.030 --> 20:37.830
Thank you for the reminder, sir.

20:38.920 --> 20:40.940
But now I have no other choice.

20:40.940 --> 20:41.990
I must see

20:42.350 --> 20:44.080
my old acquaintance this time,

20:44.460 --> 20:46.190
no matter the cost.

20:46.920 --> 20:48.380
I hope my old acquaintance

20:49.240 --> 20:51.170
can understand my determination.

20:55.200 --> 20:57.570
Seems like you've made up your mind, miss.

20:57.570 --> 20:58.200
And I am

20:58.770 --> 21:00.420
no more than a street performer.

21:00.420 --> 21:02.250
I can't force anything upon you.

21:04.440 --> 21:06.030
Since the 6 wen

21:06.460 --> 21:08.180
couldn't ease your worries,

21:08.700 --> 21:09.310
how about

21:10.960 --> 21:12.010
we consider

21:12.420 --> 21:14.330
this money on credit?

21:15.250 --> 21:16.050
In the future,

21:16.750 --> 21:18.530
if you have anything to ask,

21:19.140 --> 21:21.380
I'll give you an answer for free.

21:22.050 --> 21:22.650
Farewell.

21:25.880 --> 21:26.420
Bro,

21:27.250 --> 21:29.070
I think you're quite good at this.

21:29.070 --> 21:31.800
Why don't you do
the fortune-telling for me, too?

21:33.960 --> 21:34.700
I...

21:34.700 --> 21:36.030
You can do magic tricks?

21:36.500 --> 21:38.100
What a coincidence. So can I!

21:38.420 --> 21:39.280
How about this?

21:39.740 --> 21:40.350
I'll show you

21:40.350 --> 21:41.270
a sword trick.

21:41.750 --> 21:42.950
If the people here

21:42.970 --> 21:44.220
think it's good and tip me,

21:44.220 --> 21:45.240
I'll give the money to you.

21:45.240 --> 21:46.200
If it's not good,

21:46.200 --> 21:47.700
you won't lose anything either.

21:47.700 --> 21:48.160
Wait...

21:49.850 --> 21:51.030
Who sent you?

21:53.030 --> 21:54.580
I'm just a fortune-teller.

21:57.180 --> 21:58.840
Let me play with you a bit more.

21:58.940 --> 21:59.570
Bravo!

22:09.220 --> 22:10.440
Bravo!

22:11.310 --> 22:11.810
Bravo!

22:11.810 --> 22:12.530
Bravo!

22:12.530 --> 22:13.220
Bravo!

22:13.220 --> 22:13.960
Amazing!

22:14.440 --> 22:15.050
Nice!

22:32.910 --> 22:34.050
A murder!

22:34.050 --> 22:35.050
Run!

22:35.850 --> 22:36.980
Someone was killed!

22:37.570 --> 22:38.630
There's a murder!

22:40.380 --> 22:41.250
Run!

22:41.480 --> 22:42.290
He was killed!

23:13.060 --> 23:16.260
[Zhang Changlin,
Zhang Qishan's Lieutenant]

23:29.760 --> 23:31.400
You desperado,

23:31.640 --> 23:33.070
how dare you kill people in the streets?

23:31.680 --> 23:35.130
[Changxiang Rice Noodles]

23:34.350 --> 23:35.150
The audacity.

23:36.530 --> 23:37.950
It's you.

23:38.570 --> 23:40.900
So you work for Zhang Qishan.

23:45.500 --> 23:46.230
You know him?

23:46.680 --> 23:47.460
I do.

23:47.920 --> 23:48.920
Remember I told you

23:48.920 --> 23:50.240
about a guy who disguised himself
as my friend

23:50.240 --> 23:51.420
and went down to the Archives with me?

23:51.420 --> 23:52.020
It was him.

23:56.660 --> 23:58.180
He's got a long reach,

23:58.180 --> 23:59.680
even extending into my territory.

23:59.680 --> 24:01.610
There must be something wrong
with Zhang Qishan, our relative.

24:01.610 --> 24:03.090
We can't let this continue.

24:03.090 --> 24:04.880
-When I see him...
-Let's talk about it later.

24:04.880 --> 24:07.610
-How can we talk about it later?
-We need his help.

24:08.310 --> 24:09.910
What did you make such noise?

24:09.920 --> 24:11.920
I was just praising you to my mentor.

24:12.400 --> 24:13.220
Impressive.

24:13.500 --> 24:15.240
You guys in Changxiang are so efficient.

24:15.240 --> 24:16.240
You showed up

24:16.270 --> 24:17.730
right after the incident.

24:17.810 --> 24:19.250
You were prepared in advance, huh?

24:19.250 --> 24:21.610
Now we have both witnesses and evidence.

24:21.920 --> 24:24.060
Are you still going to resist?

24:24.180 --> 24:26.440
Then don't blame me for showing no mercy.

24:48.510 --> 24:49.500
What did you do?

24:51.200 --> 24:53.330
I've been practicing brick breaking.

24:54.510 --> 24:55.230
Tell me.

24:56.010 --> 24:56.920
Just now...

25:07.270 --> 25:07.980
I...

25:07.980 --> 25:08.750
Fire!

25:21.120 --> 25:22.430
Why did you stop me?

25:22.510 --> 25:23.640
If you kill Zhang Qishan's men,

25:23.640 --> 25:25.100
how can we ask him for help?

25:25.250 --> 25:27.710
How do you know
they will definitely help us?

25:28.460 --> 25:29.480
You killed him.

25:29.480 --> 25:30.290
Go prove your innocence.

25:30.290 --> 25:30.760
What?

26:00.270 --> 26:01.030
Zhang Hailou,

26:01.030 --> 26:03.030
someone asked me to show you the way.

26:03.150 --> 26:04.470
Come on, follow me.

26:19.000 --> 26:20.960
Wait here and count to 100.

26:20.960 --> 26:22.410
Don't come out until you count to 100.

26:22.410 --> 26:24.940
Then cross the street opposite
and turn left.

26:26.540 --> 26:27.980
How do you know my name?

26:33.940 --> 26:35.240
Hurry! Find him!

26:36.290 --> 26:41.310
One, two, three, four, five.

26:59.220 --> 26:59.840
Search!

27:34.880 --> 27:36.900
[Fengxing Photo Studio]

27:35.270 --> 27:36.270
That was so scary.

27:38.530 --> 27:40.090
Zhang Qishan told me

27:40.090 --> 27:41.350
not to try a third time.

27:42.300 --> 27:44.290
So going to Changxiang
to find him this time

27:44.290 --> 27:45.810
will definitely be full of obstacles.

27:45.810 --> 27:47.210
Once I set foot in Changxiang,

27:47.210 --> 27:48.410
he will surely notice

27:48.530 --> 27:51.060
and try every means
to drive us out of the city.

27:51.610 --> 27:52.550
In this case,

27:53.290 --> 27:54.550
we might as well use it.

27:55.420 --> 27:56.830
You want to use yourself as bait

27:56.830 --> 27:57.960
to test Zhang Qishan's attitude

27:57.960 --> 27:59.960
toward us and the methods he'll use.

28:00.660 --> 28:01.990
Zhang Hailou is

28:02.090 --> 28:03.890
a great choice for drawing fire.

28:04.660 --> 28:06.520
So he and I will set off in the open,

28:07.380 --> 28:08.510
and you will move covertly

28:08.510 --> 28:09.420
and flexibly.

28:11.940 --> 28:13.920
Zhang Qishan is really cruel.

28:14.660 --> 28:16.440
Technically, I'm his uncle.

28:16.440 --> 28:17.990
No, he's my cousin.

28:18.270 --> 28:20.400
How could he try to kill me ruthlessly?

28:21.000 --> 28:22.730
I don't think it's that simple.

28:23.420 --> 28:25.180
Firstly, he has no reason to kill us.

28:25.180 --> 28:26.570
Even if he wanted to kill us,

28:26.570 --> 28:28.160
there should be easier ways.

28:28.160 --> 28:31.000
Why would he go to so much trouble
and frame you for murder?

28:31.000 --> 28:32.000
What was that for?

28:32.110 --> 28:33.000
To win a battle,

28:33.290 --> 28:34.790
speed prevails.

28:36.220 --> 28:37.480
On Zhang Qishan's turf,

28:37.480 --> 28:38.810
as long as we move fast enough,

28:38.810 --> 28:40.380
even his chain of schemes

28:40.920 --> 28:41.940
won't work.

28:43.550 --> 28:44.770
Then let's split up.

28:48.850 --> 28:50.510
How are your legs recovering?

28:51.500 --> 28:52.030
Look.

28:58.090 --> 28:58.690
Shrimpie.

29:12.420 --> 29:14.950
I finally don't have to push
your wheelchair.

29:20.660 --> 29:22.320
Actually, my legs

29:23.570 --> 29:25.080
aren't fully healed.

29:25.740 --> 29:27.240
Fine, I can push it for you.

29:28.010 --> 29:29.530
Do you see that pillar ahead?

29:29.530 --> 29:31.160
We are at the same starting line.

29:31.160 --> 29:32.600
If you can run faster than me,

29:32.600 --> 29:34.460
I'll push it one more time for you.

29:34.940 --> 29:36.260
Three, two, one. Go.

29:41.000 --> 29:42.590
See? You gave up.

29:44.510 --> 29:46.420
Alright, let's get down to business.

29:46.420 --> 29:48.640
I think we should still stick together
and move.

29:48.640 --> 29:49.420
Any ideas?

29:51.880 --> 29:53.880
About the street performer you met,

29:54.180 --> 29:55.480
was he a decent-looking scholar,

29:55.480 --> 29:56.700
wearing glasses,

29:56.700 --> 29:58.360
talking in a mysterious tone,

29:58.750 --> 30:00.530
looking very much like a fortune-teller?

30:00.530 --> 30:02.790
When exactly did you come to Changxiang?

30:05.700 --> 30:07.700
That person is no street performer,

30:08.000 --> 30:09.670
but from the Eighth Clan
of the Nine Clans.

30:09.670 --> 30:13.130
He's Qi Tiezui, the Eighth Master Qi,
known as the Divine Seer.

30:14.830 --> 30:16.290
A member of the Nine Clans?

30:17.590 --> 30:18.790
This Qi family is

30:18.790 --> 30:20.750
pretty special among the Nine Clans.

30:20.750 --> 30:22.220
Other forces rely on opening stores

30:22.220 --> 30:23.420
to build their power.

30:23.680 --> 30:24.850
But Qi Tiezui

30:25.230 --> 30:26.430
only needs one store,

30:27.180 --> 30:28.610
and it's a fortune-telling shop.

30:28.430 --> 30:30.790
[Buy One & Get
One Fortune-Telling for Free]

30:29.030 --> 30:30.000
Take care, sir.

30:30.660 --> 30:31.460
Sir, want to tell your fortune?

30:31.460 --> 30:32.150
Normally speaking...

30:32.150 --> 30:32.750
Come in, please.

30:32.750 --> 30:33.750
Such a small shop

30:33.750 --> 30:36.050
would have easily been eliminated
in Changxiang.

30:36.050 --> 30:37.160
But the Qi family

30:37.160 --> 30:38.890
has survived for generations,

30:39.000 --> 30:41.460
and their business
has always been booming.

30:42.240 --> 30:43.610
It's because Qi Tiezui

30:44.160 --> 30:45.950
has a very weird habit.

30:46.270 --> 30:47.700
As long as a customer buys something,

30:47.700 --> 30:49.030
he tells their fortune.

30:49.200 --> 30:51.260
It's called a free fortune-telling.

30:51.510 --> 30:52.740
And he's incredibly accurate.

30:52.740 --> 30:53.880
Thank you.

30:53.880 --> 30:55.200
The Eighth Mystic Seer,

30:55.200 --> 30:57.250
known as the best fortune-teller
in Changxiang,

30:57.250 --> 30:58.850
has no equal in Changxiang.

31:00.490 --> 31:02.310
The Archives investigated him, too.

31:02.310 --> 31:03.710
The evaluation of him is,

31:04.830 --> 31:06.180
"miraculous."

31:06.180 --> 31:08.500
He relies on his ability
to see through the world's secrets.

31:08.500 --> 31:10.900
Great Master Buddha Zhang
highly values him

31:10.900 --> 31:13.360
and even takes him along
when solving cases.

31:15.380 --> 31:18.110
Since Zhang Qishan is
on such good terms with him,

31:19.610 --> 31:21.740
he probably wouldn't bear to kill him.

31:24.010 --> 31:26.250
If I were Great Master Buddha Zhang,

31:26.550 --> 31:28.810
I would have definitely hidden him well.

31:32.070 --> 31:34.130
What scheme are you cooking up again?

31:34.290 --> 31:36.050
You can run, but you can't hide.

31:39.280 --> 31:43.820
[Qi Tiezui, from the Eighth Clan
of the Old Nine Clans]

31:44.050 --> 31:45.740
Changxiang City

31:46.980 --> 31:48.310
is not peaceful today.

31:50.630 --> 31:51.250
Fire!

31:51.250 --> 31:52.140
It's on fire!

31:52.140 --> 31:52.680
Fire!

31:52.680 --> 31:53.740
It's on fire!

31:53.740 --> 31:54.550
Come put out the fire! Hurry!

31:54.550 --> 31:55.530
Put out the fire!

31:55.530 --> 31:56.510
Put it out!

31:59.330 --> 32:00.260
Put out the fire!

32:02.940 --> 32:04.200
It looks like this fire

32:04.770 --> 32:06.480
will burn for a while.

32:12.400 --> 32:13.140
Oh, no!

32:13.140 --> 32:13.640
Well...

32:14.240 --> 32:16.240
Isn't this the location of my house?

32:17.200 --> 32:18.060
Eighth Master,

32:18.330 --> 32:19.350
Great Master Buddha instructed

32:19.350 --> 32:20.380
that you cannot go out.

32:20.380 --> 32:22.000
My house is on fire!

32:23.030 --> 32:23.900
You know what?

32:24.060 --> 32:25.880
Our Qi family's ancient scrolls
and secret texts spanning 7 generations

32:25.880 --> 32:26.940
are all inside there!

32:26.940 --> 32:27.940
If they burn down,

32:28.110 --> 32:30.000
your Great Master Buddha
can't afford the compensation even if he

32:30.000 --> 32:30.920
sells the Zhang's Residence!

32:30.920 --> 32:31.770
Get out of the way!

32:31.770 --> 32:32.430
Move aside!

32:33.250 --> 32:34.110
Eighth Master!

32:34.940 --> 32:36.200
Isn't this the fortune-teller's house?

32:36.200 --> 32:36.980
Why is it on fire?

32:36.980 --> 32:37.940
This is too scary.

32:37.940 --> 32:38.550
Exactly.

32:38.550 --> 32:39.410
So terrifying.

32:40.990 --> 32:42.020
My blanket!

32:44.930 --> 32:45.380
You...

32:45.380 --> 32:46.420
My blanket!

33:12.210 --> 33:13.110
Street performer,

33:13.110 --> 33:14.400
I see your head is

33:14.400 --> 33:16.000
still on your neck, huh?

33:17.290 --> 33:18.230
Bro,

33:18.480 --> 33:19.680
it looks like you will

33:20.140 --> 33:21.480
lose your head today.

33:27.770 --> 33:30.050
How dare you two little rogues

33:30.050 --> 33:31.630
act wildly here?

33:32.320 --> 33:34.680
Do you know what kind of place
Changxiang is?

33:34.680 --> 33:37.140
I don't think you can
escape anywhere today.

33:38.110 --> 33:39.910
Who said we were going to escape?

33:40.500 --> 33:41.360
Eighth Master,

33:41.850 --> 33:42.980
are you still alive?

33:44.270 --> 33:45.290
I'm still alive!

33:45.890 --> 33:47.620
Whether he will be alive or dead

33:48.900 --> 33:50.330
depends on my mood.

33:51.200 --> 33:52.050
How about this?

33:52.050 --> 33:53.310
Firstly, apologize to me

33:53.310 --> 33:54.030
sincerely.

33:54.500 --> 33:56.460
And then bring Zhang Qishan here.

33:56.780 --> 33:58.040
I will only talk to him.

34:00.350 --> 34:02.200
You committed arson, caused trouble,

34:02.200 --> 34:04.050
and kidnapped innocent civilians.

34:04.050 --> 34:05.550
With multiple crimes combined,

34:05.550 --> 34:06.850
you will be severely punished.

34:06.850 --> 34:08.260
Release him immediately,

34:08.260 --> 34:10.219
or we'll shoot you to death.

34:10.440 --> 34:10.900
I...

34:11.460 --> 34:12.500
I'm still inside!

34:12.500 --> 34:14.100
Don't you care about my life?

34:14.780 --> 34:15.639
Eighth Master,

34:16.170 --> 34:17.980
why didn't you wait for me here
before going in?

34:17.980 --> 34:18.989
What nonsense!

34:19.110 --> 34:20.370
If my house burns down,

34:20.380 --> 34:22.510
can you take responsibility for that?

34:25.860 --> 34:26.320
Go.

34:37.460 --> 34:38.310
Seven.

35:16.280 --> 35:19.250
My enamel pearl patterned vase...

35:20.590 --> 35:21.320
Of all the things

35:21.320 --> 35:22.480
you could throw,

35:22.480 --> 35:24.270
why did you throw this one?
